# The committed test maps are text INI, generated by tools.scale_map and read
# by tools.run_test_map; the binary-map rule above is meant for retail maps.
!/tests/maps/*.map
*_todo.md

# No trailing slash: a linked worktree reaches the retail INIs through an
# `ini` symlink, which a directory-only pattern does not match.
/ini

